thub.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-30T16:46:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T13:54:48Z","closed_at":"2026-04-21T13:54:48Z","assignee":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.5.2, 4.6.1, 4.7\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3 - macOS Tahoe (26.3.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Pro (Apple7) - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe results of `get_method_list` contains incorrect return data for abstract methods.  The `return.type` and `return.usage` fields are not set correctly.\n\nAlthough this is how the metadata has been historically, due to the changes in return type checks in 4.7 it has become an issue when dynamically generating code.  When generating an implementation for the abstract method I must know whether or not I can include `return` clauses.  Without correct return metadata I cannot reliably create wrappers.\n\n\n## Workarounds\nIt is possible for the user to give my tool information about how to create wrappers, but this has a number of drawbacks.\n\nThe user could also create a local class that extends the abstract class, but this is tedious.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends SceneTree\n@abstract\nclass AbstractClass:\n\t@abstract\n\tfunc abstract_method() -> int\n\n\nclass ExtendsAbstract:\n\textends AbstractClass\n\n\tfunc abstract_method() -> int:\n\t\treturn 10\n\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tprint(\"AbstractClass\")\n\tfor method in (AbstractClass as Variant).get_script_method_list():\n\t\tprint(JSON.stringify(method, \"    \"))\n\n\tprint(\"ExtendsAbstract\")\n\tfor method in (ExtendsAbstract as Variant).get_script_method_list():\n\t\tprint(JSON.stringify(method, \"    \"))\n```\n\nWhich results in\n```\nAbstractClass\n{\n    \"args\": [],\n    \"default_args\": [],\n    \"flags\": 129,\n    \"id\": 0,\n    \"name\": \"abstract_method\",\n    \"return\": {\n        \"class_name\": \"\",\n        \"hint\": 0,\n        \"hint_string\": \"\",\n        \"name\": \"\",\n        \"type\": 0,\n        \"usage\": 6\n    }\n}\n\nExtendsAbstract\n{\n    \"args\": [],\n    \"default_args\": [],\n    \"flags\": 1,\n    \"id\": 0,\n    \"name\": \"abstract_method\",\n    \"return\": {\n        \"class_name\": \"\",\n        \"hint\": 0,\n        \"hint_string\": \"\",\n        \"name\": \"\",\n        \"type\": 2,\n        \"usage\": 0\n    }\n}\n{\n    \"args\": [],\n    \"default_args\": [],\n    \"flags\": 129,\n    \"id\": 0,\n    \"name\": \"abstract_method\",\n    \"return\": {\n        \"class_name\": \"\",\n        \"hint\": 0,\n        \"hint_string\": \"\",\n        \"name\": \"\",\n        \"type\": 0,\n        \"usage\": 6\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThe `return.type` and `return.usage` in all metadata should be the same as the local version in `ExtendsAbstract`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee steps to reproduce","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118011/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"comple